msgid "Enable Glimpse"
msgstr "Omogoči Glimpse"

msgid ""
"Tip: open Glimpse instantly with a gesture.\n"
"\n"
"Set one under Settings → Taps and gestures → Gesture manager → pick a "
"gesture → Reader → 'Open Glimpse'.\n"
"\n"
"(This tip is shown only once.)"
msgstr ""
"Namig: odprite Glimpse takoj s potezo.\n"
"\n"
"Nastavite jo v Nastavitve → Dotiki in poteze → Upravitelj potez → izberite "
"potezo → Bralnik → 'Odpri Glimpse'.\n"
"\n"
"(Ta namig je prikazan samo enkrat.)"

msgid "Mode: Show all images"
msgstr "Način: Pokaži vse slike"

msgid "Mode: Show images up to current chapter"
msgstr "Način: Pokaži slike do trenutnega poglavja"

msgid "Show images up to current chapter"
msgstr "Pokaži slike do trenutnega poglavja"

msgid ""
"Images that appear beyond your current position stay hidden, so you can't "
"spoil yourself. Granularity is per chapter: images in the chapter you are "
"currently reading are shown."
msgstr ""
"Slike, ki se pojavijo za vašim trenutnim položajem, ostanejo skrite, da si "
"ne razkrijete vsebine. Granularnost je po poglavjih: slike v poglavju, ki ga "
"trenutno berete, so prikazane."

msgid "Show all images"
msgstr "Pokaži vse slike"

msgid ""
"Show reference images from anywhere in the book, including parts you haven't "
"reached yet."
msgstr ""
"Pokaži referenčne slike iz katerega koli dela knjige, vključno z deli, ki "
"jih še niste dosegli."

